WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.050
Gaima's Ambition

00:08.000 --> 00:10.840
A Shiba would be nice.

01:42.380 --> 01:43.770
Hey Durtle!

01:43.770 --> 01:44.970
It's me, Durtle.

01:46.590 --> 01:49.160
Come on, Durtle, open up!

01:49.460 --> 01:50.340
It's Gyo!

01:50.340 --> 01:52.220
I said open up!

01:52.620 --> 01:55.480
What now? I don't remember doing anything wrong.

01:55.980 --> 01:57.580
I'll run away for now.

01:57.580 --> 01:58.180
Durtle!

01:58.180 --> 01:59.140
Oh shit!

02:00.560 --> 02:02.360
Durtle Wings!

02:02.360 --> 02:04.880
Domestic Arm!

02:05.410 --> 02:06.100
Ow!

02:07.310 --> 02:09.330
You thought you could run away, didn't you?

02:09.330 --> 02:11.140
What did I do?

02:11.140 --> 02:12.370
You didn't do anything.

02:12.370 --> 02:13.680
Then why are you chasing me?

02:13.680 --> 02:15.130
It's because you ran first!

02:17.710 --> 02:19.160
I need you to do me a solid.

02:19.160 --> 02:20.400
I don't have any money, if that's what you're asking.

02:20.400 --> 02:22.290
Wrong again, dumbass.

02:22.290 --> 02:24.570
There's gonna be a group blind date tonight, so you better be there, okay?

02:25.500 --> 02:26.500
A group blind date?

02:32.980 --> 02:34.460
Thanks for coming out tonight, dudes and dudettes.

02:34.460 --> 02:35.960
Cheers!

02:35.960 --> 02:37.470
Cheers!

02:37.470 --> 02:39.740
Why don't we go around and introduce ourselves.

02:39.740 --> 02:40.980
I'm Yoko.

02:40.980 --> 02:42.850
I'm Akemi.

02:42.850 --> 02:44.170
I'm Satoko.

02:44.170 --> 02:45.310
I'm Junko.

02:45.310 --> 02:46.910
I'm Gyo.

02:46.910 --> 02:48.210
I'm Durtle.

02:48.210 --> 02:49.640
I'm Hellskull.

02:49.640 --> 02:51.910
We've got some awesome people here tonight, I see.

02:51.910 --> 02:54.180
Where's your fourth guy?

02:54.180 --> 02:56.070
He should be here by now.

02:56.070 --> 02:58.060
Maybe he's still putting on his makeup or something.

03:00.530 --> 03:03.830
That damn Geirus is killing us.

03:03.830 --> 03:06.200
I'll have to keep them distracted for now.

03:06.200 --> 03:07.780
I guess we can let my Domestic Arm take over

03:07.780 --> 03:11.070
until Geirus gets here then.

03:12.270 --> 03:15.470
N-Nice to meet you ladies.

03:15.470 --> 03:18.070
That's cute <i>and</i> disgusting!

03:18.070 --> 03:19.740
Gyo's on fire today!

03:19.740 --> 03:21.730
He's really getting to them.

03:21.730 --> 03:24.080
Let's all drink and eat until we pass out tonight!

03:24.080 --> 03:25.680
I've got us all covered if we need more.

03:26.080 --> 03:27.180
Come on, now.

03:27.180 --> 03:29.290
What took you so long, Fried Calamari?

03:32.490 --> 03:34.310
There you guys are.

03:34.760 --> 03:36.250
Master Vamp?

03:41.610 --> 03:43.810
Gaima's Ambition.

03:50.390 --> 03:53.060
I guess I'll have to buy a collar too.

03:58.580 --> 04:02.160
Regarding next week's operation, General Hengel...

04:05.140 --> 04:06.230
Excuse me.

04:08.260 --> 04:09.220
My apologies.

04:09.720 --> 04:16.170
I was just daydreaming about being chased by a group of naked beautiful women.

04:19.160 --> 04:21.460
So, you were saying?

04:35.890 --> 04:39.020
You know that fable about the golden axe and the silver axe, right?

04:39.020 --> 04:43.720
Ever wonder what would happen if the woodcutter dropped a piece of sushi instead of an axe?

04:43.720 --> 04:45.260
I mean, even if you were to answer honestly,

04:45.260 --> 04:48.450
you'd still be getting back a piece of sushi you dropped into the lake.

04:51.370 --> 04:52.340
Whatever.

05:03.710 --> 05:05.780
If you think about it, God would have to pick up all the little pieces of rice

05:05.780 --> 05:07.390
that got scattered once the sushi was droppe-

05:07.390 --> 05:09.150
Go to sleep already!

05:15.320 --> 05:16.640
Master Vamp?

05:17.540 --> 05:19.340
Why are you here?

05:19.340 --> 05:22.250
Geirus told me you guys would be here.

05:22.250 --> 05:25.590
I received a call over at the base from Geirus,

05:25.590 --> 05:28.880
and he said he was trying to call you to tell you that he wasn't feeling well,

05:28.880 --> 05:32.630
but he couldn't get through to you.

05:32.630 --> 05:35.090
You didn't have to come all the way here just to tell us that, Master Vamp.

05:35.550 --> 05:38.170
I thought maybe you guys would have been worried about him.

05:38.170 --> 05:39.620
I'm so sorry about this.

05:39.620 --> 05:41.520
Please sit here and take a deep breath for now.

05:41.520 --> 05:44.620
Yeah, you're all drenched in sweat!

05:44.920 --> 05:46.380
Thank you guys.

05:50.010 --> 05:52.600
I'll get out of everyone's hair after I rest real quick,

05:52.600 --> 05:54.990
so don't let me stop you guys from having your group matchmaking, okay?

05:55.290 --> 05:58.510
Haha, "group matchmaking" that's funny.

05:59.040 --> 06:00.490
I didn't mean anything by-

06:00.490 --> 06:01.750
Well then,

06:01.750 --> 06:05.320
let's keep going with our "group matchmaking" like he wants us to.

06:05.320 --> 06:08.100
Is it just me or does it kinda smell in here?

06:08.100 --> 06:09.040
It does.

06:10.770 --> 06:12.580
Oh, sorry.

06:12.580 --> 06:14.190
That's coming from me.

06:14.190 --> 06:16.790
I was actually making some miso-pickled vegetables before coming here.

06:17.240 --> 06:19.260
Oh, so that's what it was.

06:19.260 --> 06:21.960
It's a bit smelly, but it sure brings back memories of home.

06:21.960 --> 06:24.420
Were you really making miso-pickled vegetables, old man?

06:24.420 --> 06:27.910
Yeah. You can't beat miso-pickled vegetables when it comes to pickles.

06:28.620 --> 06:31.600
That's actually making me want to eat some right now.

06:31.600 --> 06:35.090
Oh, just come over to the base sometime then. I'll treat you to some.

06:35.090 --> 06:37.170
We'll treat you to the miso-pickled vegetables,

06:37.170 --> 06:38.800
but remember to Bring Your Own Rice, okay?

06:38.800 --> 06:40.500
Oh, don't worry, I'll at least serve you some miso soup on the side.

06:40.500 --> 06:43.230
You're so funny, Master Vamp!

06:49.610 --> 06:51.990
What? World domination?

06:51.990 --> 06:54.250
Was that supposed to be a joke?

06:54.250 --> 06:56.750
We're trying to do it for reals!

06:56.750 --> 06:59.610
That's definitely not the reaction I hoped for.

06:59.610 --> 07:01.800
Anyway, there's this annoying guy called Red, and-

07:01.890 --> 07:04.940
Oh no, I got something red on my sleeve.

07:04.940 --> 07:06.450
You should wipe it off with a hand towel right away.

07:05.280 --> 07:06.950
This is supposed to be my lucky dress, too...

07:06.450 --> 07:07.720
Hold on a second.

07:07.720 --> 07:10.850
Red wine stains can be removed using white wine.

07:10.850 --> 07:12.040
Really?

07:12.890 --> 07:14.450
Oh, it really can!

07:14.450 --> 07:15.200
Really?

07:15.200 --> 07:16.550
Wow!

07:16.550 --> 07:18.780
You're like a walking encyclopedia, Master Vamp.

07:18.780 --> 07:21.870
I learned this from watching Mythbusters.

07:21.870 --> 07:23.610
Ok, that should do it.

07:23.610 --> 07:26.500
You're awesome, Master Vamp!

07:26.910 --> 07:28.460
Oh my, look at the time.

07:28.460 --> 07:30.210
I should get going.

07:32.300 --> 07:35.360
But we'll be short one person if you leave, so stay.

07:36.470 --> 07:37.390
Can I really?

07:37.390 --> 07:39.940
Of course you can!

07:44.960 --> 07:46.060
Damn it.

07:46.060 --> 07:49.040
Nothing's been going my way since Master Vamp got here.

07:49.340 --> 07:52.340
Lamb's really good for diets, you know.

07:52.340 --> 07:55.020
We're actually really into Mongolian Barbecue right now!

07:55.020 --> 07:56.700
Apparently gourds help you lose weight too.

07:56.700 --> 07:58.830
...and that's the answer to our Double Jeopardy question!

07:58.830 --> 08:00.760
Oh god, who watches that anymore.

08:00.760 --> 08:02.830
It's actually the gourd seeds that make you lose weight.

08:02.830 --> 08:07.140
I don't know anything about dieting so I can't join in on this conversation, damn it!

08:07.140 --> 08:08.900
This is bad. Really bad.

08:08.900 --> 08:10.540
Gyo looks really pissed off.

08:10.540 --> 08:12.030
Y-Yeah.

08:15.110 --> 08:18.250
I can't turn this around unless I do something forcefully.

08:18.250 --> 08:20.430
It could be risky, but...

08:20.430 --> 08:23.310
I know this is out of the blue, but I'm going to do a Yoshio Kojima impression for you guys!

08:28.750 --> 08:31.170
That's awesome, Gyo!

08:34.320 --> 08:35.660
All right!

08:35.660 --> 08:37.520
I banged my pinky toe

08:39.400 --> 08:41.280
on the bottom of the drawer,

08:43.130 --> 08:45.600
so I leapt in pain and bumped my head into the pilkar-

08:46.010 --> 08:48.400
I meant to say pillar...

08:48.400 --> 08:50.200
He screwed up!

08:51.900 --> 08:53.670
But that's okay for me.

08:53.670 --> 08:55.520
But that's okay for me?

08:55.520 --> 08:57.460
But that's okay for me!

08:57.460 --> 08:58.420
And now, OPP-

08:58.820 --> 09:00.020
Really?

09:00.020 --> 09:02.380
That must have been terrible.

09:02.380 --> 09:04.390
Master Vamp!

09:08.690 --> 09:10.920
Hey, Gyo...

09:10.920 --> 09:13.910
Why don't we try this again some other time?

09:13.910 --> 09:15.280
Shut up!

09:15.280 --> 09:17.340
Why, damn it! Why?

09:17.340 --> 09:18.110
You there.

09:18.110 --> 09:19.070
What the hell do you-

09:21.410 --> 09:22.180
You've got the wrong guy!

09:22.180 --> 09:24.410
I wasn't doing anything wrong!

09:22.380 --> 09:24.810
That was fun.

09:24.410 --> 09:25.160
There's gotta be some mistake here.

09:25.160 --> 09:26.110
I'm really sorry.

09:26.110 --> 09:27.840
Guys, help me out here!

09:27.840 --> 09:29.220
Come on!

09:32.630 --> 09:34.430
Damn it!

09:34.430 --> 09:36.780
I was the one who organized the group blind date, man.

09:36.780 --> 09:37.930
Mr. Red-

09:37.930 --> 09:38.830
Yeah, I feel you.

09:38.830 --> 09:42.550
It's really hard to reset the pace at these things once it's all messed up.

09:42.750 --> 09:43.820
Damn it, man!

09:43.820 --> 09:44.460
Don't worry about it.

09:44.460 --> 09:45.770
It should have been me.

09:45.770 --> 09:47.530
Astro Fighter Sunred.

09:47.530 --> 09:50.250
This is the magnificent story of the conflict between good and evil

09:50.250 --> 09:54.010
which takes place in the city of Kawasaki.

09:57.300 --> 10:00.420
Vamp's Quick Cooking!

10:00.420 --> 10:02.590
Hi everyone, Vamp here.

10:02.590 --> 10:05.550
Let's cook our hats off on this fifth episode as well!

10:05.550 --> 10:08.160
Easy cooking!

10:08.160 --> 10:10.350
Getting down to business as usual,

10:10.350 --> 10:11.920
today we'll be cooking an Oyako-katsudon.

10:11.920 --> 10:15.580
It's a type of Katsudon you can make with the chicken cutlets they sell at your local supermarket.

10:15.580 --> 10:17.280
The ingredients you will need are:

10:17.280 --> 10:20.090
A piece of chicken cutlet bought at your local supermarket;

10:20.090 --> 10:21.690
some onions;

10:21.690 --> 10:23.280
an egg;

10:23.280 --> 10:25.410
some pre-mixed sukiyaki sauce;

10:25.410 --> 10:27.870
and maybe a glass of water.

10:27.870 --> 10:30.220
Let's get to cooking.

10:30.220 --> 10:33.430
First boil the onions you've sliced in the sukiyaki sauce.

10:33.430 --> 10:37.730
You can adjust the flavor of the sauce to your liking by adding water to it.

10:37.730 --> 10:41.330
Slice the chicken cutlet while the onions are boiling.

10:41.330 --> 10:43.470
Cut them to any size you want.

10:43.470 --> 10:47.100
Once the onions become soft, dump in the cutlets that you've sliced up

10:47.100 --> 10:49.050
then boil them together under high heat.

10:49.050 --> 10:52.310
And while you do that, stir up the egg you've set aside.

10:52.310 --> 10:55.670
Once the cutlet's become nice and warm, pour the stirred egg over it

10:55.670 --> 10:59.090
and once the egg's become all nice and cooked, kill the flame.

10:59.090 --> 11:01.230
Put the cooked cutlets on top of rice and...

11:02.140 --> 11:06.900
the Oyako-katsudon is ready to be served.

11:06.900 --> 11:10.560
It's like a mix between an oyakodon and a katsudon, isn't it, Mr. Red?

11:10.560 --> 11:13.740
You should really give up world domination and start a restaurant instead.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.370
Gaima's Ambition.

12:53.090 --> 12:54.380
Yeah.

12:56.160 --> 13:00.020
I should probably get an indoor dog.
